	"id": "NG00182_B214E043_STD",
	"name": "Novel Alzheimer's Risk Loci in Korean and Japanese participants: APOE\u03b54 non-carrier",
	"description": "GWAS summary statistics from a meta-analysis of single-variant association tests, where analyses were performed separately within each cohort and then combined. The dataset comprises 4,132 APOE\u03b54 non-carriers, including 1,349 Alzheimer\u2019s disease (AD) cases and 2,783 controls. These samples derive from the Korean GARD cohort (2,195 individuals: 773 AD cases, 1,422 controls; WGS-based GWAS) and the Japanese JGSCAD cohort (1,937 individuals: 576 AD cases, 1,361 controls; SNP array\u2013based GWAS).",
